_m2","opens":"door_m2","pos":[12.0,1.2000000476837158,-20.0]}},{"Receptor":{"id":"recv_branch","opens":"door_branch","pos":[-13.5,1.2000000476837158,-38.0]}},{"BeamSource":{"dir":1,"id":"beam_m5","pos":[-15.0,1.2000000476837158,14.0]}},{"Mirror":{"facing":1,"id":"mirror_m5a","pos":[-4.0,0.0,14.0]}},{"Mirror":{"facing":3,"id":"mirror_m5b","pos":[-4.0,0.0,20.0]}},{"Receptor":{"id":"recv_m5","opens":"door_m5","pos":[12.0,1.2000000476837158,20.0]}},{"Message":{"id":"msg_glass_mouth","pos":[0.0,0.0,-88.0],"text":"Glasswing Grotto. The crystal hums, and the light inside it has nowhere to go but along the walls. The way goes north."}},{"Message":{"id":"msg_glass_mirror","pos":[-3.0,0.0,-58.0],"text":"A beam of light runs from the wall to a crystal mirror, and stops. Turn the mirror with the interact key until it throws the light north, to the socket by the door."}},{"Message":{"id":"msg_glass_socket","pos":[3.0,0.0,-52.0],"text":"A socket in the floor. When a beam reaches it, it stays lit, and the door beside it opens for good."}},{"Message":{"id":"msg_glass_prism","pos":[0.0,0.0,-38.0],"text":"The Prism Hall. Three mirrors and two sockets. Each socket opens a different door; one beam is enough for both, one at a time."}},{"Message":{"id":"msg_glass_branch","pos":[-14.0,0.0,-23.0],"text":"A sealed tunnel in the west wall. Its socket is on the far side of the hall, behind the beam's other turn."}},{"Message":{"id":"msg_glass_nook","pos":[-34.0,0.0,-22.0],"text":"The Shard Nook. Someone left a spear-shaped thing on a slab, and a chest beside it. Nothing here was meant to be found."}},{"Message":{"id":"msg_glass_facets","pos":[0.0,0.0,-4.0],"text":"The Gallery of Facets. The first mirror throws the light to the second, and the second to the socket. Things sleep in the crystal; the light will wake them."}},{"Message":{"id":"msg_glass_guardian","pos":[0.0,0.0,30.0],"text":"The Guardian Hall. Two Glasswing Stalkers hold it, nearly invisible when still. A spear stands on a plinth